diff -u -r a/CraneExtract.v b/CraneExtract.v
--- a/CraneExtract.v	2026-11-11 05:17:53.821872997 +0000
+++ b/CraneExtract.v	2026-11-11 05:17:53.825873025 +0000
@@ -6,30 +6,13 @@
 From Crane Require Extraction.
 From BackendCrane Require Import CraneMap.
 From Nanofil Require Import Term Maps Transport.
-From Backend Require Import Text Asm Layout EmitData EmitModule Compile IrText.
+From Backend Require Import Text Asm Layout EmitData EmitModule Compile IrText Abi.
 
 Set Crane Format Style "None".
-Set Crane Extraction Output Directory ".".
+Set Crane Extraction Output Directory "x".
 Set Crane Loopify.
 Set Crane NonAtomicRc.
-Set Crane Loopify Diagnostics.
-(* Their inner fixpoint is called under an operator, and the loop Crane
-   writes for that names a function it never declares.  Both recurse
-   only as deep as a term nests. *)
-Crane NoLoopify term_eqb Order.term_compare.
-
-(* How the C++ holds its data; the campaign doc's M8 has what each is
-   worth on rx.ir. An inductive's alternatives are in Crane's own
-   variant, and a field that is another inductive is a pointer, as in
-   OCaml. A term nests only as deep as IR text does, so its destructor
-   recurses once a level and does not drain into fresh cells.
-
-   [Set Crane GC], which is off, is the other way to hold it: no counts
-   and no destructors, with every block from a collector that has
-   Boehm's API. main.cpp and nfrt.h follow the CRANE_GC the header then
-   defines, and the program links libgc. *)
-Set Crane FastVariant. Set Crane BoxedFields.
-Set Crane BoundedNesting.
-
-Crane Extraction "nb" read_text compile compile_promoted compile_allocated
+Set Crane SharedVariant.
+Crane NoLoopify term_eqb Order.term_compare Abi.one_per_symbol.
+Crane Separate Extraction read_text compile compile_promoted compile_allocated
   rev_lines_parts first_todo.
